214
00:11:01,420 --> 00:11:05,920
The main approaches for trying
to act efficiently in Markov

215
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:07,540
decision processes
and we're going

216
00:11:07,540 --> 00:11:10,690
to start by focusing on the
tabular setting, will again

