00:52:02,430 --> 00:52:04,650
OK, so eventually, it happens.

962
00:52:04,650 --> 00:52:07,050
But then you can get
two concurrent UCRL

963
00:52:07,050 --> 00:52:11,010
where in this case,
you can start to--

964
00:52:11,010 --> 00:52:13,350
if you don't do something
smart, again, this

965
00:52:13,350 --> 00:52:15,550
can end up being
not very effective.

966
00:52:15,550 --> 00:52:19,930
And let me just see if I can
